This project adds deployment, detection, selective routing and a LuCI child
page to the existing EasyTier OpenWrt integration. It is not an official
EasyTier release or a complete replacement management interface.

Upstream menu/API layout and visual conventions were reviewed against
EasyTier/luci-app-easytier, Apache-2.0, commit
79b2b01ded627a634e4bea8d60c7be0f00b708b0.

